candidatas.text:
Out of all the isekai or reincarnation manhwa/webtoons I have read so far, this one is pretty unique. The whole game like feature in the beginning was pretty cool. I'm glad that the author doesn't just skip over how she came into the game world like a lot of others do. Lot of other webtoons just &nbsp;half-ass the&nbsp;past, but here her&nbsp;past background story is incorporated into her new life.
It's pretty interesting so far. I can't judge the storyline completely because the translations are just getting into the main plot.&nbsp;
I totally recommend this especially&nbsp;if you are&nbsp;into this genre. The art style is gorgeous. I am a sucker for pretty characters. Just don't be quick to judge since it gets better the more you read it. Hopefully my opinion doesn't change cuz that would be quite disappointing.

